{
    "title": "Vikiroom:Not Just a Dating App",
    "description": "<b>Vikiroom: Not Just a Dating App</b>\r\n\r\nGone are the days when communication, dating and entertainment were incompatible. For a while, you can lose yourself. In books, in games, in art, in love. Let yourself get lost...\r\n\r\nStart your journey today and plunge with us not only into exciting dates, but also into many entertaining and connecting people opportunities!\r\n\r\n<b>MEET</b>\r\n\u2014 Meet people from all over the world or in your immediate vicinity!\r\n\u2014 Simple and intuitive interface creates no boundaries for communication and entertainment!\r\n\u2014 Fill out the profile as you wish, and also see the profiles of other people in just one click!\r\n\u2014 Flexible recommendation system ensures you never run out of options.\r\n\u2014 Even if you are far from home, you can always choose who and where to look: closer to home or on a trip!\r\n\u2014 Can't find a match? Don't worry, you'll still have plenty of opportunities to start a conversation. Send a Fire Message or Gift and see what happens!\r\n\r\n<b>NOT JUST A DATING APP</b>\r\n\u2014 Spend your time with pleasure in new interesting Vikiroom games, the catalog of which is constantly updated!\r\n\u2014 Have fun, play and get into Vikiroom Top. This will be noticed by all users who will immediately want to ask you how you did it so cleverly!\r\n\u2014 Read interesting Vikiroom channels that were created especially for you: about psychology, intimology, astrology and much more.\r\n\u2014 Share these articles with others: start a dialogue, discuss and smile! You will never run out of topics to talk about!\r\n\u2014 Use other Vikiroom Services: tarot cards, fire messages and more!\r\n\r\n<b>GIFTS AND LOOT BOXES</b>\r\n\u2014 Our gifts are not just famous stickers given once and forgotten forever, but digital goods in the full sense of the word, which can be collected, donated, exchanged.\r\n\u2014 While \u00abregular\u00bb gifts are sweet, try getting \"rare\" or even higher level gifts to definitely impress with your collection!\r\n\u2014 Open Loot Boxes to get more gifts for your collection! Classic, seasonal, event and even very rare ones that will never be opened again!\r\n\u2014 Some gifts will be stored in the Loot Boxes for a limited time, which means that they will become very popular collectibles. Who wouldn't want to have them all? It's fun \u2014 try it yourself!\r\n\u2014 Your collection of rare gifts can put you on the Vikiroom Top list for the whole world to see!\r\n\r\n<b>Start your Vikiroom journey with us right now! Not Just A Dating App!</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Vikiroom: Not Just a Dating App</b><br><br>Gone are the days when communication, dating and entertainment were incompatible. For a while, you can lose yourself. In books, in games, in art, in love. Let yourself get lost...<br><br>Start your journey today and plunge with us not only into exciting dates, but also into many entertaining and connecting people opportunities!<br><br><b>MEET</b><br>\u2014 Meet people from all over the world or in your immediate vicinity!<br>\u2014 Simple and intuitive interface creates no boundaries for communication and entertainment!<br>\u2014 Fill out the profile as you wish, and also see the profiles of other people in just one click!<br>\u2014 Flexible recommendation system ensures you never run out of options.<br>\u2014 Even if you are far from home, you can always choose who and where to look: closer to home or on a trip!<br>\u2014 Can&#39;t find a match? Don&#39;t worry, you&#39;ll still have plenty of opportunities to start a conversation. Send a Fire Message or Gift and see what happens!<br><br><b>NOT JUST A DATING APP</b><br>\u2014 Spend your time with pleasure in new interesting Vikiroom games, the catalog of which is constantly updated!<br>\u2014 Have fun, play and get into Vikiroom Top. This will be noticed by all users who will immediately want to ask you how you did it so cleverly!<br>\u2014 Read interesting Vikiroom channels that were created especially for you: about psychology, intimology, astrology and much more.<br>\u2014 Share these articles with others: start a dialogue, discuss and smile! You will never run out of topics to talk about!<br>\u2014 Use other Vikiroom Services: tarot cards, fire messages and more!<br><br><b>GIFTS AND LOOT BOXES</b><br>\u2014 Our gifts are not just famous stickers given once and forgotten forever, but digital goods in the full sense of the word, which can be collected, donated, exchanged.<br>\u2014 While \u00abregular\u00bb gifts are sweet, try getting &quot;rare&quot; or even higher level gifts to definitely impress with your collection!<br>\u2014 Open Loot Boxes to get more gifts for your collection! Classic, seasonal, event and even very rare ones that will never be opened again!<br>\u2014 Some gifts will be stored in the Loot Boxes for a limited time, which means that they will become very popular collectibles. Who wouldn&#39;t want to have them all? It&#39;s fun \u2014 try it yourself!<br>\u2014 Your collection of rare gifts can put you on the Vikiroom Top list for the whole world to see!<br><br><b>Start your Vikiroom journey with us right now! Not Just A Dating App!</b>",
